  "description": "What: CE-4650 (NA-5, R-4281 fun pack) - an ARCHER AMBUSH. Four 'Patrol n' soldiers (type 2002) walk east along y=150 on the farm, starting about 40 m short of the ambush; three 'Ambusher n' warriors (type 2016, bows) lie in wait 35 m north of the road at x 120-140, each ordered to shoot one patrol soldier with silent arrows. Arrows make no gunshot, so the patrol reacts only on SEEING an archer or being hit. Judge: the ambushers hit the patrol (three or more arrows), at least two patrol soldiers fall, and the patrol never fires back (the arrows made no gunshot and the archers lie unseen - the one soldier not shot just walks on)."
 },
